== Modifiers ==
{{Main|Greenhouse}}
{{Sectionstub}}
Placed '''Mutations''' affect their surrounding Mutations and Crops. These effects will lock once the Mutation or Crop reach their final stage. 

Planting unique Crops in [[Greenhouse]] will give {{Green|+2.5% Yield}} and {{Green|+2.5% Growth Speed}} per, up to {{Green|10}} times ({{Item|Moonflower}} and {{Item|Sunflower}} count as the same crop, same for {{Item|Red Mushroom}} and {{Item|Brown Mushroom}}). This bonus can also be obtained with the [[Flora Shard]].

== Tips ==
* Players can enable the {{Green|Confirm breaking ungrown Mutations}} in their [[Settings]] menu, which can help prevent accidentaly breaking some '''Mutations'''.
** This setting only applies to '''Mutations''' that the player planted themselves, not '''Mutations''' that spread naturally. This may or may not be a bug.{{InfoNeeded}}

